---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing & Packages | Ecosoft"
  description="Transparent ERP investment with no software licence fees. Indicative ranges for Starter, Standard, and Enterprise packages to help you plan your project."
>


  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 42rem;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Pricing &amp; Packages</p>
        <h1>Transparent investment. No licence surprise.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
          Every Ecosoft project is scoped individually — your business is unique, and your ERP
          investment should reflect your actual requirements. Below are indicative ranges to help
          you plan and self-qualify.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-card-badges" style="margin-top: 0;">
          <span>฿0 Software Licence</span>
          <span>Full Source Code Included</span>
          <span>No Vendor Lock-In</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING TABLE -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="background: var(--bg-card-blue); border: 1px solid var(--border-blue); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-subtle);">
        <strong style="color: var(--text);">Note on Pricing:</strong> There are no software licence fees.
        All Ecosoft pricing covers consulting, implementation, customisation, training, and first-year support.
        You own the source code and can maintain it with any developer after the project closes.
      </div>

      <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
      <table class="pricing-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Package</th>
            <th>Starter</th>
            <th class="col-featured">Standard</th>
            <th>Enterprise</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Best For</strong></td>
            <td>SMEs, 5–20 users, 1–2 modules</td>
            <td>Growing companies, 20–100 users, full ERP</td>
            <td>Large organisations, complex requirements, Government / Multi-company</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Indicative Range</strong></td>
            <td class="price-highlight">฿300K – ฿800K</td>
            <td class="price-highlight">฿800K – ฿3M</td>
            <td class="price-highlight">฿3M+<br /><span style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400;">(scoped individually)</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Licence Cost</strong></td>
            <td>฿0 (100% open source)</td>
            <td>฿0 (100% open source)</td>
            <td>฿0 (100% open source)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>What's Included</strong></td>
            <td>Discovery, configuration, training, 1-year support</td>
            <td>All Starter + custom modules, migration, advanced training</td>
            <td>Full scope, multi-entity, dedicated team, SLA support</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Users</strong></td>
            <td>5 – 20</td>
            <td>20 – 100</td>
            <td>100+</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Custom Modules</strong></td>
            <td>Standard OCA modules</td>
            <td>Custom modules included</td>
            <td>Full bespoke development</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Data Migration</strong></td>
            <td>Basic migration</td>
            <td>Full migration included</td>
            <td>Complex migration &amp; cleansing</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Training</strong></td>
            <td>Standard user training</td>
            <td>Advanced training + documentation</td>
            <td>Train-the-trainer + full documentation</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Post Go-Live Support</strong></td>
            <td>1-year standard support</td>
            <td>1-year priority support</td>
            <td>SLA-based dedicated support</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <p class="pricing-note">
        Prices are indicative. All projects are quoted after a free discovery session.
        Contact us for an accurate proposal tailored to your exact requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY NO LICENCE FEES -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why ฿0 Licence Cost</p>
        <h2>The money that doesn't go to SAP stays in your business</h2>
        <p>
          A typical SAP or Oracle implementation requires six-figure annual licence payments —
          before you pay a single consultant. Odoo Community Edition and ERPNext are 100% free.
          That budget funds better implementation, more thorough training, and deeper customisation.
        </p>
      </header>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">01</span>
          <h3>No Annual Renewal</h3>
          <p>Your licence cost is ฿0 in year one — and every year after. Your ERP investment is a one-time implementation, not a recurring fee.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">02</span>
          <h3>You Own the Code</h3>
          <p>At project completion, Ecosoft delivers all source code. You can hand it to any developer in the world to maintain or extend.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">03</span>
          <h3>Budget for Quality</h3>
          <p>The licence savings fund better consultation, more custom modules, deeper training — the things that actually make ERP succeed.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">04</span>
          <h3>Total Cost of Ownership</h3>
          <p>Open-source ERP with a quality implementor typically delivers 60–80% lower 5-year TCO compared to proprietary alternatives.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container cta-strip-grid">
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>Get an accurate proposal for your project</h3>
        <p>All quotes follow a free 1-hour discovery session. No obligation — just an honest scope and budget range.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white">Request a Free Proposal</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>Not sure which package fits?</h3>
        <p>Take our 5-minute ERP Readiness Assessment and get a personalised recommendation.</p>
        <a href="/erp-readiness-assessment" class="btn btn-teal-outline">Take the Assessment →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
